### Feature Flags

#### Interoperability

| Feature      | Version | Summary |
| :----------- | :------ | :------ |
| `borsh`      | 1.6     | Derives `borsh::{BorshSerialize, BorshDeserialize}`
| `bson`       | 3.1     | Implements `From<T> for bson::Bson`
| `serde`      | 1.0     | Derives `serde::{Serialize, Deserialize}`

